snippet me "File header comment" b
`!p
import datetime
name = vim.eval("get(g:, 'my_name', 'Name not set')")
email = vim.eval("get(g:, 'my_email', '')")
license = vim.eval("get(g:, 'my_license', 'MIT')")
date = datetime.datetime.now().strftime("%B %d, %Y")

snip.rv = (
    " * # Created\n"
    " * Author: {0} <{1}>\n"
    " * Date: {2}\n"
    " *\n"
    " * # Contributors\n"
    " * - {0} <{1}>\n"
    " */"
).format(name, email, date)
`
endsnippet

